{"id":452,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为更好地帮助同学们解决考研备考过程中遇到的问题，本学期数学学院大学数学教学中心统一安排数学高阶课程（高等数学、线性代数、概率论与数理统计）答疑。答疑时间是从第8周开始，每周四下午16:00-18:00（五一假期后调整为16:30-18:30）。具体答疑地点及课程安排如下：</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hnzN3iM7LinzlYMB7-8nNWVLmvinlCGsU4TfM4liolrVUlC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yPU1yaokyPUzTfL47aU8r2MRr7L494nm-aLlrfoRN4ozWFLm98nRnRMRMFMllDM1baptveo4OevsAZ_ShXptQ0g47PLR-0MmNbMYbw62f8c&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=6997&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F1B081A9A310CEF45D383F201EA89392/284D4C43/5E66\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"555\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hnzN3iM7LinzlYMB7-8nNWVLmvinlCGsU4TfM4liolrVUlC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yPU1yaokyPUzTfL47aU8r2MRr7L494nm-aLlrfoRN4ozWFLm98nRnRMRMFMllDM1baptveo4OevsAZ_ShXptQ0g47PLR-0MmNbMYbw62f8c&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=6997&e=.png\"></p><p></p><p>欢迎同学们带着复习中遇到的各类数学问题前来交流，老师们将为大家悉心解惑！</p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://math.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hnzN3iM7LinzlYMB7-8nNWVLmvinlCGsU4TfM4liolrVUlC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yPU1yaokyPUzTfL47aU8r2MRr7L494nm-aLlrfoRN4ozWFLm98nRnRMRMFMllDM1baptveo4OevsAZ_ShXptQ0g47PLR-0MmNbMYbw62f8c&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=6997&e=.png"}